<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="airasia_airplane_boarding_scene (image)">
  <data key="d0">airasia_airplane_boarding_scene (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image shows a group of travelers boarding an AirAsia airplane via a portable stairway on the tarmac, under a bright blue sky. The scene marks the start of a journey mentioned in the diary, emphasizing the travel theme and connection to AirAsia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-275905083998c55789bd8b56aef77919</data>
  <data key="d4">旅行日记2.pdf</data>
