</node>
<node id="Hand Holding Spread of 500 Indian Rupee Notes (image)">
  <data key="d0">Hand Holding Spread of 500 Indian Rupee Notes (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">A close-up image of a hand fanning out multiple ₹500 Indian rupee banknotes, highlighting currency details and emphasizing an aspect of travel preparations or documentation of expenses in India.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6da89fa70c21fe7860b484600d94e4ae</data>
  <data key="d4">旅行日记2.pdf</data>
