<node id="India Study Tour Group at Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath (image)">
  <data key="d0">India Study Tour Group at Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">Photograph of a diverse group visiting the Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath, India, during a travel/study vlog, as indicated by the overlaid Chinese text referencing a journey between key Indian cities from late 2023 to early 2024.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cdd7a4d9454f132a13be8bd3ad8ab39c</data>
  <data key="d4">旅行日记2.pdf</data>
