<node id="digital_asset_upload_modal_interface (image)">
  <data key="d0">digital_asset_upload_modal_interface (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image shows a file upload modal overlaying a digital asset management dashboard in a Chinese-language web platform. The modal details supported file types and current upload status, while the background grid displays image and audio thumbnails. The interface supports efficient creative asset organization.</data>
