<node id="Creative Asset Management Upload Modal (image)">
  <data key="d0">Creative Asset Management Upload Modal (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">Screenshot of a browser-based creative asset management system. Central upload dialog overlays a media asset grid and navigation panel. The interface displays accepted file types, storage usage, and file upload controls, reflecting context-specific file type enumeration.</data>
