<node id="digital_asset_upload_modal_asset_manager (image)">
  <data key="d0">digital_asset_upload_modal_asset_manager (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This is a screenshot of a Chinese digital asset management platform with an upload modal. Users can drag-and-drop media files or select files for upload, managing various projects and assets, with clear categorization and visual file previews displayed in the active interface.</data>
