  <data key="d0">airasia_passenger_boarding_aircraft_clear_sky (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">The image captures passengers boarding an AirAsia Airbus aircraft on the tarmac under a clear blue sky, evoking a theme of travel and anticipation. The composition and context suggest documentation for a travel diary or journey-themed content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b7d73f144558f38b7ac679328d895d</data>
