  <data key="d0">Hand-holding-fanned-Indian-500-rupee-banknotes (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image documents a hand holding a substantial, fanned stack of Indian 500 rupee banknotes. It signifies financial preparation for travel, closely tying to the surrounding context of a travel diary referencing currency and international movement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12bc5b49faebb38b93b15c233a29a09c</data>
